    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/746e417b0eca9b3a27802cb4d973ecee.avif?t=1754444832\" /></span><br><strong>SkySouls is a Third Person Action and Adventure Game in the style of D.Souls but with a story told with epic cinematics</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a medieval fantasy world where kings and magical creatures collide in an epic showdown. In the realm of SkySouls, peace is threatened by the evil Demon King Ossur, who opens a portal to hell unleashing destruction. A young human, Solid, the son of a brave fallen soldier, emerges as the last hope for his world. He accompanies Solid on an epic journey as he faces deadly challenges, forges unlikely alliances, and discovers legendary artifacts. Face the darkness in &quot;SkySouls&quot;, where bravery and magic intertwine in a fight for survival and peace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/fb905ae4b99b736c0ff0f54ad62266f5.poster.avif?t=1754444832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/fb905ae4b99b736c0ff0f54ad62266f5.webm?t=1754444832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/fb905ae4b99b736c0ff0f54ad62266f5.mp4?t=1754444832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><br>\u2192 Bow: Master precision and stealth as you fire arrows from the shadows, dealing damage at a distance.<br>\u2192 Crossbow: Unleash deadly bolts with deadly precision and keep your enemies at bay from a distance.<br>\u2192 Short Sword: Unleash quick slashes and agile attacks in close combat, keeping your enemies at bay.<br>\u2192 Long Sword: Strike with force and precision with this versatile weapon that offers both quick slashes and powerful attacks.<br>\u2192 warhammer: Destroy your enemies with brutal hammer blows, shattering armor and bone alike.<br>\u2192 Magic: Master the arcane arts and cast devastating spells to devastate your enemies from a distance.<br>\u2192 Sword and Shield: Find the balance between attack and defense while wielding a sword and shield, protecting yourself while delivering precise blows.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/746e417b0eca9b3a27802cb4d973ecee.avif?t=1754444832\" /></span><br><strong>SkySouls is a Third Person Action and Adventure Game in the style of D.Souls but with a story told with epic cinematics</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a medieval fantasy world where kings and magical creatures collide in an epic showdown. In the realm of SkySouls, peace is threatened by the evil Demon King Ossur, who opens a portal to hell unleashing destruction. A young human, Solid, the son of a brave fallen soldier, emerges as the last hope for his world. He accompanies Solid on an epic journey as he faces deadly challenges, forges unlikely alliances, and discovers legendary artifacts. Face the darkness in &quot;SkySouls&quot;, where bravery and magic intertwine in a fight for survival and peace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/fb905ae4b99b736c0ff0f54ad62266f5.poster.avif?t=1754444832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/fb905ae4b99b736c0ff0f54ad62266f5.webm?t=1754444832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369590/extras/fb905ae4b99b736c0ff0f54ad62266f5.mp4?t=1754444832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><br>\u2192 Bow: Master precision and stealth as you fire arrows from the shadows, dealing damage at a distance.<br>\u2192 Crossbow: Unleash deadly bolts with deadly precision and keep your enemies at bay from a distance.<br>\u2192 Short Sword: Unleash quick slashes and agile attacks in close combat, keeping your enemies at bay.<br>\u2192 Long Sword: Strike with force and precision with this versatile weapon that offers both quick slashes and powerful attacks.<br>\u2192 warhammer: Destroy your enemies with brutal hammer blows, shattering armor and bone alike.<br>\u2192 Magic: Master the arcane arts and cast devastating spells to devastate your enemies from a distance.<br>\u2192 Sword and Shield: Find the balance between attack and defense while wielding a sword and shield, protecting yourself while delivering precise blows.</strong>",
